WEBVTT

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:33.042
First, the need
for immediate gratification

00:03:33.084 --> 00:03:34.377
and quick results.

00:03:34.961 --> 00:03:38.172
And second, our own discomfort with play,

00:03:38.172 --> 00:03:41.259
either because we don't have
the time or energy,

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.803
or because we just don't know
how to play anymore.

00:03:44.845 --> 00:03:46.847
On the topic of immediate gratification,

00:03:46.889 --> 00:03:51.102
I think back to that Excel document
I created as a first-year teacher.

00:03:51.852 --> 00:03:56.524
That document was
the manifestation of my anxiety,

00:03:56.565 --> 00:03:59.902
because often when we feel anxious
or out of control,

00:03:59.944 --> 00:04:02.613
we revert back to what we can control.